# === Rust ===
/target/
**/target/

# Ignore Cargo.lock in libraries
/Cargo.lock
**/Cargo.lock

# === IDEs and editors ===
# VS Code
.vscode/

# IntelliJ / RustRover
.idea/
*.iml

# Other editors
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# === OS-specific ===
# macOS
.DS_Store

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux
*.bak

# === Logs and temp files ===
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.out

# === Backup / build artifacts ===
*.old
*.orig

# === By-products ===
